{"id":"08a6ddab7f132c97","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-directed-system.md","title":"Directed System","display":"df-directed-system — Directed System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-directed-system","aliases":["58-df-directed-system","Directed System"],"display":"df-directed-system — Directed System","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-directed-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-directed-system</span><span>Directed System</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-directed-system — Directed System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,X,f,\\leq_I\\in V\">\\(I,X,f,\\leq_I\\in V\\)</span> (index set, object family, transition-map family, and index preorder)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\)</span> (directed-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirSys}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{DirSys}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (precise predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(f,\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:i\\leq_I j\\},\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\leq_I j\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f(\\langle i,j\\rangle),X(i),X(j))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(f(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{X(i)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\leq_I j\\land j\\leq_I k\\to f(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=f(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(f,\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:i\\leq_I j\\},\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\leq_I j\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f(\\langle i,j\\rangle),X(i),X(j))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(f(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{X(i)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\leq_I j\\land j\\leq_I k\\to f(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=f(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed\\text{-}system\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\\mathrm{DirSys}_S(X,f,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_I\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed\\text{-}system\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\\mathrm{DirSys}_S(X,f,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_I\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The precise predicate treats the object family and transition-map family as set-coded functions and carries the directing relation explicitly.</li>\n<li>Directed system: objects indexed by directed set; maps going forward.</li>\n<li>Colimit: universal object receiving consistent maps from all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i\">\\(X_i\\)</span>; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5e64f0c882e3eee\" href=\"?note=d5e64f0c882e3eee\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-colimit.md\">../batch17/58-df-colimit.md</a>.</li>\n<li>Sheaf: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varinjlim U_i = \\mathcal{F}(U)\">\\(\\varinjlim U_i = \\mathcal{F}(U)\\)</span> for open cover refinement</li>\n<li>Homology: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varinjlim H_n(U_i)\">\\(\\varinjlim H_n(U_i)\\)</span> in Čech homology; Mayer-Vietoris for homology</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Directed}_S$ (directed-set predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-coded function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-colimit.md","status":"resolved","id":"d5e64f0c882e3eee","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Colimit: universal object receiving consistent maps from all $X_i$; see [[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,X,f,\\leq_I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirSys}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Directed}_S(I,\\leq_I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(X))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(f,\\{\\langle i,j\\rangle\\in I^2:i\\leq_I j\\},\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\leq_I j\\to\\mathrm{Function}(f(\\langle i,j\\rangle),X(i),X(j))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(f(\\langle i,i\\rangle)=\\operatorname{id}_{X(i)}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\;\\bigl(i\\leq_I j\\land j\\leq_I k\\to f(\\langle j,k\\rangle)\\circ f(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=f(\\langle i,k\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}directed\\text{-}system\\text{-}compatibility}\\vdash\\mathrm{DirSys}_S(X,f,I)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_I\\in V\\;\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S(X,f,I,\\leq_I)","display":true},{"tex":"X_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\varinjlim U_i = \\mathcal{F}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varinjlim H_n(U_i)","display":false}],"bytes":2184,"backlinks":[{"id":"2eaad590ac255c04","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirectedSystem}_S$ (order-explicit directed-system predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md]])"},{"id":"3bb6eb53bb335d65","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DirectedPreorder}(I,\\preceq)$ and $I\\ne\\varnothing$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-435","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-directed-system.md|58-df-directed-system]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["e61c089fc5e610a6","36d7463d215be751","d5e64f0c882e3eee"]}